    "content" : "µ of the U(1)B−L, a SM singlet B − L Higgs boson Ψ with two U(1)B−L charge, and three RH neutrinos Ni which are necessary for the gauge and gravitational anomaly cancellations. In describing the RH neutrinos, we use the four component representation of RH neutrino constructed from the Weyl spinor νR"
