    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "For the two RH neutrinos, N1 and N2, we assign Z2 parity even, while odd for N3, so that the RH neutrino N3 is stable and, hence, the DM candidate."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
