    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Dµ = Dµ(SM) − iqB−LgB−LZµ′ , (2) where Dµ(SM) is the covariant derivative in the SM, and qB−L is the charge of each ﬁelds under the U(1)B−L with its gauge coupling gB−L."
